{"server":"cn","storyId":"act16mini_level_act16mini_st03","groupId":"act16mini","stageId":null,"title":"狂奔的瓶树","storyCode":"","avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act16mini/level_act16mini_st03.txt","sourceHash":"81ed32ed8cdf69970e4659d36e3391db25c97b5d1b6b07fce134d6a2d529eac8","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"46_g4_rmbtwild_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个，我......我觉得我们不能从大风滩经过。那一带几乎是天灾的领地，每年有七万辆运载车在经过大风滩时受损甚至彻底毁坏......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不对，我们的车身本来就已经受损了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那、那应该看看这个，除了天灾以外，可能进一步导致载具损坏的常见因素......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"源石燃料泄漏、传动系统故障导致二次事故、靠近开采场而被炸药波及......所以我们要避开矿石开采场......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，有人在听吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对，小锅盖，从这里爬上去，就锯那根树枝，锯完再把水泵接到树顶上！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小锅盖","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"电锯......沉沉的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小锅盖","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没关系......兰娜姐给的脚扣绑得很紧，只要想象自己像大树鼷兽一样，用脚扣牢牢地抓住树干，“咻”地一下跳上去......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小锅盖","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我一定能把事情做好的，能让大家开开心心的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小锅盖","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......咦？背上突然轻了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......喂，劫车的，我可没叫你来干活！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，你没有让我做任何事情。不过，我有开采瓶树水的经验。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，我承认你有点良心，但还是麻烦你把工具还给小锅盖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"毕竟，比起你这个劫车的，我当然更信任我的老搭档。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小锅盖","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再说，我们又不是真的要当什么瓶树水专用运货车。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们只是需要在进入移动平台之前伪装一下这辆车而已，别让人看出这是一辆偏离了航线的城际公共交通运载车。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"顺带再贴点装饰——在用修补铁皮钉上之前，可别让人看出来这辆车被打穿了好几个洞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小锅盖，咱们串通好的口供，你再教劫车的说一遍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小锅盖","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小锅盖","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果有人问，就说我们正在运输这棵瓶树，并且还要把树干里的水装桶送去工厂，车上的树枝装饰是生产队队长的爱好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没错。我编的这套说法肯定没问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，真没想到，瓶树这玩意不仅在我们躲天灾长时间偏离方向的时候能救命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我真的爱死那些会在偏远荒野上种瓶树的运载车司机了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然，包括我自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，我去驾驶室了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......呃，请问有人在听吗？那个，我还想提醒一下......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......每年有三十万人在运载工具上遭遇不同原因导致的骨折，其中从运载车搬运的瓶树上掉下来骨折的有一万五千人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小锅盖","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"别听他的。我会慢慢启动水泵，保证你不会被震到从树上掉下来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但事故总是突如其来的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好，我启动了！小锅盖，抓稳！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"每年——每年还有一千多人！因为突发的大风天气——导致树干歪斜——而丧——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小锅盖","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我成功了欸，兰娜姐！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小锅盖","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"水泵开始“嗡嗡”地从树干里吸水了！嘿嘿，我最喜欢看这个时刻了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，不然我为什么说信任你呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个，水泵其实也有可能爆炸......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么，你手里是有死神的名单吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我每年都能听到一两个老朋友染上矿石病、出意外或者被卷进天灾的消息，干哪行的都逃不掉。照你的说法，我就该什么都不做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......呃，抱歉，我只是想以我有限的知识，给你们提供一点......参考，大概能参考吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我，我是......保险公司的推销员......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“保险”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是我这几年在广告上见过的最好的东西！我买了很多份，并且衷心希望能帮这家哥伦比亚公司把它宣传出去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"毕竟，我......我胆子很小的，什么都怕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是保险把我怕的东西全都想到了，连我本来不知道的危险都想到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看，这是我的工作笔记......这些数据汇集自我们公司的若干条广告，能告诉你生活中有哪些你想不到的危险！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，他们承诺，如果坏事真的发生了，就会给我赔偿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦。但是人死了还能花钱吗？难道他们发明出了死后继续生活的办法？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，我觉得......恐怕是不太可能的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那没意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我来给你说个实在的。帮忙打扮好这辆车，等会儿我们开去附近的移动平台，我看看某个老朋友在不在家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"每年哪些载具在哪里遇到天灾？不重要。去咧嘴谷的路怎么开能避开危险，我直接问她就完事了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"46_g3_rmbttown"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......事情怎么会变成这样的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"本来我还以为那个小朋友会乖乖躲在车上，然后我只要跟她一起挤在那个小工具间里就行了，多有安全感啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......结果她居然要跟阿兰娜女士一起走亲访友，把我一个人留在车上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......一个人......留在一辆被劫走、私藏感染者、强行冲岗、挨了几发火箭炮的运载车上......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我我我我可没办法应付来追杀的人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，跟着谁都好，哪怕跟着你也行，只要别让我一个人面对问题就好......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——这这这这是我的钱包我真的只有这么点钱您先拿好！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我不是说不愿意跟着你！呃，但不想当人质也是人之常情，对吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人质？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我懂的，你是劫车的，我跟着你走，当然就是给你当人质。你刚刚救人的时候身手那么敏捷，不愧是匪徒......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......对不起！我是说你真厉害！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是、是啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......你没生气吧？太好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个，我还是想求你一件事，阿兰娜让你采购运载车长途行驶需要的物资......我们能不能就真的是去采购，别用抢劫的方法？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看，我的钱包也在你手上了，钱不多，但是买食物和燃料应该够用了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......那就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，我、我有种不好的直觉。刚才关口的工作人员打量我们的眼神，好像怪怪的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是专业的。你觉得......我们会不会已经被怀疑了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，我没说过我想要人质。我说过，想下车的人可以走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不走吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......啊？我以为这个话题已经过去了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要去咧嘴谷，和你没有关系。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那条路很危险，我考虑过这个问题了，所以给了下车的机会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你怕危险，又为什么不走？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那、那你人这么好，能不能陪我进这家报刊亭看一眼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以给你一个解释......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有......这一版也没有......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"莱伊女士，我的脸应该被报纸挡住了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，我再仔细翻翻......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......呼，太好了，我还没上寻人启事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，不过，如果他们真的发了寻人启事，确实一天之内也上不了报纸......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"通缉令呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也没有——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不不，不是你想的那样！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......逃婚了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，其实也不是我要逃婚，是我正好坐着这辆车准备去另一座城市参加订婚仪式，正好这辆车被你劫走了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然后......我还挺开心的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳，其实这好像也不是什么大事，就是因为不是什么大事我才不好意思跟别人说......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道你家有多少人，但反正我有三十六个兄弟姐妹和数不清的亲戚长辈......很多事情就变得，说不说都一样......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好吧，你看起来不懂，我也知道，一般大家庭虽然也有这么多人，但不是这样的氛围。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我不知道......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......等等，莱伊，那边有穿制服的人过来了，和先前检查站的人一样......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我并没有生活在一个大家庭里。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些接在一起的大屋子都很漂亮。不过，我不知道自己拼在什么地方才会比较合适。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个札拉克不见了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，那他应该是自己离开了。他一开始就应该下车的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"穿制服的工作人员","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"你好，这位女士，我们想跟你聊聊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g3_cottage"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别怕，小锅盖，虽然墙上挂的照片都很吓人，但这屋子的主人没什么奇怪的爱好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她是拍了一些原始森林里的巨大野兽尸体、瘴气中成堆的探险家骨头之类的，但她自己不伤人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，应该不会伤人吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小锅盖","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，我叫你小锅盖你都不顶嘴了，这么没精神，难道是肚子饿了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道劫车的靠不靠谱，她最好是能顺利把东西都买回来，等会儿我给你展示一手——用太阳能电池板烤泡面饼，再烙几个羽兽蛋！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小锅盖","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......过去的事情就别想了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"反正现在我有办法。你看，劫车的是不是看起来有点奇怪，有点......疯？所以我就想到来见这个朋友，把情况问清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"山一样巨大的影子？还会说话？如果雷姆必拓真的有这种玩意，我这个朋友一定听说过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但如果，那个劫车的只是喝多了，或者下矿没戴安全帽脑子被石头砸了个坑，那......我就想别的办法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别怕，我可是“荒野上的阿兰娜”，我总是有办法的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不见，统统不见，姑奶奶正忙着写游记呢，没看到门口贴的牌子吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——不对，知道我这个临时工作间的人就没几个，你是哪家杂志社的？从哪里跟踪过来的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小锅盖","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"兰娜姐......你们不是老朋友吗？她看起来......不认识你呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，这个嘛......老朋友的意思就是很多年没见过啦......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿，就那次，去大哈默矿坑，你记不记得？有只裂兽追着咱们咬，你说那可能是有史以来人类目击到的最大裂兽的那次？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，就是墙上这张！你拍下这张照片的时候，我就是那个开车的司机。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......行吧，管你什么人什么事，给你十分钟时间，我就这么点耐心。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（忍耐，再忍耐五秒钟，等那几双皮鞋从视野里消失......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（......四，三，二，一......）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——咳咳咳......呸！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，吃两口土应该不会进医院吧，就算是载具底盘上风干的沙土......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，我摸到了，这里应该就是通向底层动力室的检修门。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走在街上太可怕了，我还是钻回车里等着她们回来就好......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......呃，也不知道莱伊女士还能不能回来......我不是故意把她丢下的，但真的太对不起她了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一，二——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阀门总算拧开了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"46_g1_transporter"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陌生的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1186_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个，真、真的很对不起！我我我认错车了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我这就缩回去......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车外的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"等一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车外的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这辆车车底好像有动静。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陌生的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1186_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘘——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陌生的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1186_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）安静点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陌生的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1186_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）要是你害得我被发现了，别想有好果子吃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（用力地点头）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车外的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我们真的不能再让磐蟹爬进车站了，更不能让它们在载具里面产卵！上次那只又报废了三辆车！还扎伤了两个人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车外的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"手电筒拿来，必须检查一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（绝望地用手势胡乱比划）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陌生的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1186_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陌生的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1186_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）上来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"46_g3_rmbttown"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯，这些优惠券是别人交给我的，我对你们这里的市场并不熟悉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"穿制服的工作人员","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"那你干嘛要回答我们的市场调研问题啊？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因为你们问了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"穿制服的工作人员","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，好吧，刚刚那段笔录作废！打扰你了，女士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没关系。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......“月度促销杂志，剪下即可享受压缩罐头九折。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这种东西是什么时候出现的呢......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"兰娜真厉害啊，生活中的每件事情，新的旧的，都弄得清清楚楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"“周五，可以把毛绒尾巴老爷子织的围巾拿出来，从他当班的女儿那里拿个友情价。”嗯，每一天的日期，她也记得很清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"这一叠纸片可以在“三百万辆手推车”超级市场使用，然后这一叠......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是的，博士，其实就连我的记忆也有点模糊了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"雷姆必拓好像一直都是这样。生锈的厂房，层层叠叠的钢架，灰蒙蒙的天空和地平线上高耸的源石晶簇......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"avg_230_savage_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，阿米娅，我也很希望你能真正回家看看......我按照你父母的资料打听了很久。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"avg_230_savage_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是那次工程队遇袭之后，你以前生活的移动平台也被拆解了。现在这个平台，是我能找到的接收了最多旧地块的平台。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"没关系的，暴行姐姐，这已经足够了。谢谢你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"仅仅是闻到这些锈铁、机油和焊条的味道，我就已经觉得很亲切了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"就好像......回到了很久很久以前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，不能这么说，其实也只有几年而已......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是......会恍惚觉得自己正坐在工程车里，跟着爸爸妈妈，还有工程队的长辈们，等待车队从移动平台出发。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"跟着工程队？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"avg_230_savage_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很多大家庭的习惯就是这样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"avg_230_savage_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一个家庭就是一支工程队，如果全工程队要前往很远很远的地方干活，就会把要照顾的老人孩子都带上一起走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"avg_230_savage_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大家庭里的人当然也不一定都有血缘关系，有时候就是大家都住在厂区的同一角，自然就算作一个大家庭了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"所以，那个时候......","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，博士不用这么感伤的......我并不是想起了最后那次事故。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，回到雷姆必拓之前，我就已经好好想过，自己想寻找的究竟是什么了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，博士，看那边！我记得那个大烟囱，以前......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"avg_230_savage_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么了，阿米娅？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......以前我和另外一些小孩子会比赛谁能往里面爬得最深，谁能保持自己的尾巴最干净......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"这是不是太危险了？","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"没关系，为了不被家里大人骂，大家都不会爬到特别危险的深度的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"avg_230_savage_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真是的，好久没听到阿米娅说这种话了。"}]},{"label":"听起来很有趣，我也想试试。","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"恐怕不行哦，博士，你没有尾巴呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"avg_230_savage_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真是的，好久没听到阿米娅说这种话了。"}]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我也不是当时那个七八岁的小孩子了呀！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......但我终于还是认出了这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"avg_230_savage_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里毕竟是雷姆必拓嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"avg_230_savage_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们搭房子的习惯就是这样。旧房子那么好用，没必要拆掉，想要新屋子，往上加盖就是了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"avg_230_savage_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以啊，我们从小就会在长辈那里听到一个说法......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......“爱冒险的家伙们无论走了多远，回来的时候都一定能认出家。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，变化的地方也有很多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"比如说我们刚刚在这个自治州接触到的感染者管理法，看起来是模仿了莱塔尼亚的法律逻辑和维多利亚的专业术语......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"阿米娅。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"有人盯着你很久了。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我注意到了，博士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"阿米娅，你认识她吗？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我没有印象......而且，以前在雷姆必拓照顾过我的人，应该都认不出现在的我了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"没关系的，博士，我们继续往前走吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......优惠券纸片和对应的购物清单，好像弄混了。兰娜交代我的事情，是什么来着......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g3_cottage"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这就是结论，从大风滩到咧嘴谷，这是天灾信使凭经验总结出来的天灾频发区域，我之前也亲自去过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？有没有什么特别的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"特别在于，那地方的生态环境简直可以说是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可以说是——？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——羽不拉屎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然雷姆必拓的地理环境总体来说比较贫瘠吧，但能荒芜到羽不拉屎的程度，实在是太特别了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好走的路？想都别想。天上掉下来的石头给你铺条路还差不多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也别以为能找到什么刺激，你能看到的也就只有那些在雷姆必拓随处可见的、随时可能会把人弄死的东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，除了不拉屎的羽兽，还有没有什么特别的动物？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别的？噢，还有数量多到特别吓人的沙地兽。相信姑奶奶我一次，别让它们缠上，能把你烦死！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行行行，沙地兽，这也没啥特别的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就没有什么“会说话的”“闪烁光芒的”“无比巨大的”动物吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这我哪知道。我又不是专业的探险家，更不是什么神秘生物学家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，别急别急......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就最后再确认一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“光线”“像山一样的巨大影子”“能对话”，这些词有没有让你想起什么？应该没有吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——你再说一遍？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"光线，像山一样的巨大影子，能......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，麻烦死了，我竟然真的帮你想到了点东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（萨尔贡语）“巨兽”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“巨兽”？这是哪里的词？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是萨尔贡语。当然，无论在哪儿，知道这个词的人都少得很。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦。萨尔贡是哪里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不不，萨尔贡是哪里不重要，您宝贵的时间还是用来解释“巨兽”是什么吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈？你刚刚没听到我说吗？无论在哪儿，知道这个词的人都少得很！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，我可解释不了，解释什么都是胡说八道。我没听说哪里有人真的研究清楚了巨兽是什么东西，这个概念我也只是偶然得知而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"得了，就现在，给我把这个词忘掉，别瞎想，更别到处乱说。姑奶奶最烦的就是一传十十传百的假传说了，每次都害得我白跑一趟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好好好，我这就忘掉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别感激我，也别夸我。十分钟到了，门在那边，明白我的意思吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是，明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......但我还是得说，多谢。有你最开始那一句话，让我知道那种东西真的存在，就够了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......哼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“光线”？“山一样的影子”？“巨兽”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谁会相信那么荒唐的东西？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"假传说真是越来越离谱了，骗鬼也别再想骗到姑奶奶头上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要不......等我把这些*雷姆必拓俚语*的调查报告都搞完，再去咧嘴谷看看吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"46_g3_rmbttown"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎么想？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小锅盖","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小锅盖","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......如果兰娜姐打算去的话，我当然会全力支持啦！虽然不懂探险也不懂考古，但我能做的事情还有很多，对不对！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？不，我是问你对于真的十分钟就被扫地出门这件事怎么想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你跟着我过来，不是为了监督我别跟朋友聊得忘记了时间吗？没想到吧，以这家伙的脾气，根本不需要你监督。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小锅盖","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，是哦......嘿嘿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"笑不出来的时候，其实......可以不那么勉强自己。就一小会儿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要是累了，想诉苦，我会把你挡住不让人看到的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——啊啊啊啊啊啊我终于看到能躲的地道了救命啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陌生的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1186_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快，快钻进去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"友情提醒一下，左边是鳞兽加工厂的排污通道，如果我是你们，我就会选另一边。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢你阿兰娜！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......呃，你好，阿兰娜，没、没想到是你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（挑起一边眉毛）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个......我快速解释一下......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我怀疑有人看穿我们的伪装了，正在关口附近进行调查。莱伊女士可能已经被缠上了，但......我希望她比我有办法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......等等，现在追着你的人是冲着我们犯的事来的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，这个可能真不是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当、当然我的事情不重要！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是躲错了地方，所以又被卷进了这位吉拉女士的麻烦事......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陌生的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1186_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接住绳子，杰里！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦......哦！我明白，我帮你把套索扔到那边，然后你把我拽下去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......总之，就是这样，阿兰娜女士......别管我了！我得跑了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......他是真的被卷进去了，还是看到别人跑自己就会跟着跑啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，小锅盖，你有没有觉得他旁边的那个人，有点眼熟？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g12_sewer"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼、呼......我们的处境究竟是变好了点，还是更糟了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"按道理来说，下水道里寄居了一窝磐蟹，这种事应该赶紧找安保人员，他们挂的“小心野生动物”标识下面是这么说的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陌生的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1186_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但不巧的是，我们就是为了躲他们才闯进这里的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......哈哈哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我已经喘不过气来了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陌生的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1186_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别放慢脚步！除非你想被那些钳子戳得浑身是洞！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我真的不太擅长逃跑......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陌生的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1186_1","isRemote":false,"text":"难道我就是什么天天逃跑的惯犯吗？我只是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陌生的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1186_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......想让周围的人都认为我失踪了，所以爬进了自己五金店运货车的货箱，在里面睡了一天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陌生的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1186_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接着货箱被正常运走了，我从别人的车里爬了出来......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陌生的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1186_1","isRemote":false,"text":"事情就变成现在这样了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不是惯犯？太好了，我还以为自己是在通缉令上见过你的脸呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，我不是想说你长相太大众......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陌生的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1186_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我倒是一直想说，你什么都不问，就协助了一个你怀疑是通缉犯的人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我只是觉得自己没得选......一开始也不知道那些人是不是来追我的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......而且，我觉得你看起来人挺好的。就像把我拐到这里来的那些人，其实也都不坏......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陌生的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1186_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......！好吵......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，这里是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我有个想法！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陌生的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1186_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陌生的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1186_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......请说？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，你听见我说话了？我、我有点不习惯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......总之，这个声音是冶炼厂的废弃物自动过滤倾倒装置，我以前在我们公司的广告里看过有人从上面摔下来严重骨折......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我的意思是，既然人会从上面摔下来，那首先人应该能上去......也许我们能从那里爬上去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些磐蟹不可能爬上高处！追我们的人也不可能猜到我们会从工厂里跑出去！我们走这边！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陌生的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1186_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走这些......随时会翻转的平台？一看就会把人甩下来的大铁块？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是完全没办法，这些机械臂的活动是定时的！我先爬上去，然后找到控制室，只要手动操作就不会有危险了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......之前看阿兰娜小姐开运载车，这个机械平台的操作杆和运载车的操纵杆应该差不多......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我或许能试试，应该只能试试......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我的意思是，我也不知道这样做行不行，但是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陌生的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1186_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我相信你，能做，就这么做吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你相信我？你是说......你不仅愿意听我的想法，还愿意相信我？我的天......你可不像我的那三十六个兄弟姐妹......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过你倒是也像他们一样又聪明又有主见——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个，对不起，吉拉小姐......这个平台比我想象的高，我......够不着......能不能推我一下？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陌生的女性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"推？推哪里......这里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也也也行，虽然我本来想的是后背或者腿......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喔，你的力气很大，总之，我上来了！真棒！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陌生的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1186_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真棒......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陌生的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1186_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）你也不像那些对我的生活指手画脚又唠唠叨叨的长辈。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"46_g2_rmbttransporter"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，没有人盯上我们，也没有人怀疑我们的车。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你真的没用这把武器放倒任何人，对吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。你在物资补给清单上列的东西太多了，我腾不出手拿武器。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好吧，结果上你没惹事就行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，我也真的不希望再出事了，检查站的事已经够小锅盖难受的了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那胆小鬼究竟跑哪里去了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"46_g3_rmbttown"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们......呼，我们安全了。竟然真的搞定了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陌生的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1186_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢你，真的，太谢谢你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，我的小心脏还在发抖呢......我，呃，我竟然真的拿了主意？还是那么危险的主意？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陌生的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1186_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......别用公文包砸自己的头了，路过的人已经在看你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，抱歉......但我真的一直习惯听别人的安排，毕竟我们大家庭很热闹......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陌生的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1186_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，我明白，大部分人不都差不多嘛。大家热热闹闹地拼凑在一起，不管有没有血缘关系都是兄弟姐妹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陌生的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1186_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我有个妹妹出发去环游整片大地已经十年啦，很多兄弟姐妹还是记不住她不在雷姆必拓这件事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陌生的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1186_1","isRemote":false,"text":"总之，被忘记也很正常，突然被家庭成员想起来然后每天被二三十个人念叨同一件事也正常。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，你说得太对了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道吗，今天我其实是逃婚逃到这里的，所以我才特别怕被人抓到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，其实是因为一点小事故被迫逃婚的......不过事故发生之后，我发现自己居然挺高兴的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然后我才意识到，自己居然那么抗拒这一安排！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我根本不认识我的订婚对象！我就是觉得......家庭里那么多聪明人都建议我这样做，那肯定就是对的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陌生的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1186_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没错！我太理解了！我家里是那些长辈天天用过来人的经验教育我，我就是不想听他们唠叨才尝试失踪的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陌生的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1186_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明明我都离开旧厂区，自己去钢铁萝卜城搞生产线了，他们还挤在一辆运载车上坐了半天，专程跑来跟我说什么，“找好了订婚对象”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陌生的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1186_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是我就那么答应了，今天就会错过......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陌生的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1186_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不，没什么。你先说吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个......吉拉小姐，我觉得，我还和你挺有默契的......那个，我们公司最近发行了一款新的保险，可以保障的范围非常广泛......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道您感不感兴趣？那个......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陌生的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1186_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？保险......？如果能帮到你的工作，我很愿意，毕竟今天多亏有你......但是保险是什么......我需要花多少钱？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不不不不，吉拉小姐，你误会了......你不需要花钱，我只是想问你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......愿不愿意做我购买的保险的受益人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陌生的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1186_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......受益人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就就就是如果我出了什么事情，公司会赔给你一大笔钱......具体有哪些条目，如果你还有时间的话，我可以慢慢和你讲......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"总而言之，受益人会是对我很重要的人......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天哪，我在说什么！我似乎又在擅自拿主意了！而且我发誓，这一定是我一生中最重要的一个主意！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陌生的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1186_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"吉拉小姐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我知道，这一切都很唐突，可这是我脑子里的真实想法，就这么一股脑地说出来了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要在以前，我可能会把这些都憋在心里，翻来覆去地想该怎么说，就算要说也会磕磕巴巴的。嗯？我好像不磕巴了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊！没事的......如果你不愿意也没事的......或许我不应该这么唐突......或许我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陌生的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1186_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我愿意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陌生的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1186_1","isRemote":false,"text":"比起听从那些长辈的安排，这样的方式更符合我的想法......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你愿意？你接受了？天哪！真应该让我的兄弟姐妹们看看，我并不是什么都要被他们卷着跑......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陌生的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1186_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白，总说着什么过来人的经验......我的家庭成员挑选订婚对象时，就好像也遵守某种家规似的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"比如说，大家都喜欢长耳朵的卡特斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陌生的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1186_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，卡特斯......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，是，我是家里唯一的札拉克，我猜自己可能很小的时候就被丢给这个大家庭照顾了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我自己都经常忘记这回事，就像平时也没人记得我一样......再说，哪个大家庭不是这样拼拼凑凑的呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，他们还都喜欢说话声音很大的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陌生的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1186_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的亲戚们认为性格安静的对象才好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有，比较懂怎么做生意的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陌生的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1186_1","isRemote":false,"text":"会做销售的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就连长相......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"有点熟悉的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1186_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"有点熟悉的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1186_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你刚刚说，你逃的也是今天的订婚仪式，对吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"46_g2_rmbttransporter"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小锅盖","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"兰娜姐，我们再不走，就要被那些拿着酒桶来装瓶树水的司机围住，走不了啦......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，我当然知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真是的，那个札拉克不是说自己怕得要死、只要下车就会发生很恐怖的事情吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我对他重申过了，想下车的人可以下车，我不会对他动手的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我觉得按照你复述的情况，他怕的是被订婚对象找到......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"莱伊！阿兰娜！赶快把你们的联系地址写给我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到时候我给你们发请柬！婚礼请柬！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......啊？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"瞭望结果显示，前面一段路应该是比较安全的，没有大型动物的足迹，也没有地面下方被野兽挖空的迹象。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，也许那个札拉克最后留给你的祝福真的有点保佑作用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“一路顺风”，还有，“不会错过自己真正要找的东西”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“巨兽”，是吗......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"听起来挺厉害的一个词，对吧？你要是一上来跟我说“我们去找巨兽”，我肯定就不会质疑你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，真没想到你还会观测路况。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我并没有足够的专业知识，我没有做过真正的瞭望员。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是......拿着望远镜向远处看的感觉，很迷人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——奇怪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"动力系统温度示数有点异常。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"劫车的，我们刚刚有没有错过什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"比如路上有个间歇泉泉眼正在冒热气，或者地表有活性源石引发了小范围爆燃之类的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看得很仔细。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那，小锅盖呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......刚刚我们都在往外看的这段时间，她跑去哪儿了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿兰娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她是不是——在动力室？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["阿米娅"]}]}
